            "description_html": "<b>Heavy Duty Parallel Arm Mount Bracket</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use with Global Door Controls TC200 series and TC2200 series with <a href=\"/products/door-closer-friction-hold-open-arm-global-hoa-1245\"><b>Global HOA-1245 Friction Hold Open Arms</b></a>. Can be used with any surface mounted closer where the arm Shoe has a 2-1/2\" Center to Center hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/parallel-arm-mount-bracket-pin-mount-global-pab-2200\"><b>Non Hold Open Arm Parallel Mount Bracket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global HOPAB-1245 Parallel Arm Mount Bracket\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n <li>Width at Header Mount: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n <li>Shoe Mount Holes: 2-1/2\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>3/16\" Thick Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>**This item is Discontinued</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
